---
import Container from '../ui/Container.astro';
import Section from '../ui/Section.astro';
---

<Section labelledby="projects-intro-title" class="border-b border-border">
  <Container width="wide">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-end lg:gap-10">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="eyebrow">Design with Intent</p>
        <h2
          id="projects-intro-title"
          class="mt-6 max-w-[12ch] font-display text-[clamp(3.5rem,6.4vw,7.6rem)] leading-[0.85] tracking-[-0.048em]"
        >
          A Considered Approach to <span class="text-accent italic">Every Space.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 lg:col-start-9 lg:pb-2">
        <p class="text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.85] text-muted sm:text-lg">
          Each environment is developed around how it should feel, function, and endure.
          Residential, commercial, and hospitality spaces are considered through proportion,
          materiality, and the experience of moving through them.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</Section>
